{"id":"n64526-1-7","stage":0,"title":"늦다 · 晚","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64526-1-7-1","ko":"벽시계가 고장이 났는지 시간이 틀리네.","zh":"墙上的钟好像坏了，时间不对呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벽시계가","meaning":"挂钟，壁钟","explanation":"벽시계：挂钟，壁钟；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"벽시계","audio":"/audio/7f1672113519be1ff055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58196","senseId":"1","lemma":"벽시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벽시계가","audio":"/audio/4a23ed429012c61c0b4a.mp3"}},{"text":"고장이","meaning":"故障","explanation":"고장：故障；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고장","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18856","senseId":"1","lemma":"고장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고장이","audio":"/audio/b777041e44a983a52170.mp3"}},{"text":"났는지","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"났는지","audio":"/audio/d22c5889b5d12deb73b2.mp3"}},{"text":"시간이","meaning":"小时","explanation":"시간：小时；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62842","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"틀리네.","meaning":"错，错误","explanation":"틀리다：错，错误；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"틀리다","audio":"/audio/5bbafb331d40a891bb62.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71481","senseId":"1","lemma":"틀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"틀리네","audio":"/audio/eb2470e65d54df8c47de.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7f1672113519be1f","term":"벽시계","zh":"挂钟，壁钟","audio":"/audio/7f1672113519be1ff055.mp3","entryId":"58196","definition":"墙壁或柱子上挂的钟表。","pronunciation":["벽씨계","